  "title": "EverCommerce Announces Sale of Its Marketing Technologies Solutions to Ignite Visibility",
  "summary": "DENVER, Oct. 31, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — EverCommerce Inc. (NASDAQ: EVCM) (“EverCommerce” or the “Company”), a leading service commerce platform, today announced that it has sold its Marketing Technology solutions to Ignite Visibility. The Market Technology solutions, collectively known as “EverConnect,” will operate as an integrated business within the Ignite Visibility product set and continue […]",
